("claimVersion.claimipedia.loadBearing.jesusIsKing.con.v1", "expression", "The proclamation does not prove itself; its historical, metaphysical, and universal claims remain contested, king-language bears coercive residue, kenosis can be weaponised against the vulnerable, and no corpus or institution may borrow divine authority from it.", "is")
