("claimVersion.claimipedia.loadBearing.jesusIsKing.kernel.v1", "expression", "The King is the one who gives himself for the life of the world; therefore no power that dominates, deceives, erases agency, abandons the vulnerable, displaces its cost, or refuses accountability may borrow his crown.", "is")
