("claimVersion.claimipedia.inquiry.missingMiddles.v1", "expression", "The strongest pro and con positions are boundary conditions for inquiry, not an exhaustive search domain: responsible corpus growth actively looks for missing middles and orthogonal dimensions that can reframe, split, qualify, or falsify the apparent binary.", "is")
("claimVersion.claimipedia.inquiry.missingMiddles.v1", "claimType", "Procedural", "is")
("claimVersion.claimipedia.inquiry.missingMiddles.v1", "scope", "A methodological commitment to open inquiry, not a presumption that every binary has a moderate compromise or that every candidate extension is true.", "is")
