("claimVersion.claimipedia.giftPossessionSplit.v1", "expression", "The gift-possession split is not a division between generous and possessive people, nor a command to abolish self-possession: it names two movements within power, distinguished by whether holding remains bounded, answerable, freely releasable, and oriented toward the good of an other who cannot be owned.", "is")
