("claimVersion.claimipedia.giftPossessionSplit.v1", "scope", "Corpus-facing semantic synthesis. It admits the goods of custody, agency, memory, responsibility, and boundary; it also identifies domination and extracted sacrifice as distinct counterfeit deformations.", "is")
